# Fondwave Slate (Dark) — Fond Dark's neutral grey surfaces, with Fondwave's
# indigo/berry/coral highlights standing in for Fond's Adwaita blue.
#
# Every background/alternate/neutral-foreground value here is copied verbatim
# from FondDark.colors. Only the accent-carrying roles change, pulled from
# Fondwave.colors' Complementary/Tooltip block — the brighter coral/peach/pink
# set it already tunes for a dark indigo backdrop — rather than the Window/
# View/Button set FondwaveSlateLight uses, which assumes a light backdrop.

